## 🔑 Why This Matters
- **Community-first validation**: Unlike enterprise protocols, Pro‑Logic Shield™ was shaped directly by feedback from first responders, disaster volunteers, and underserved communities.  
- **Unique technical differentiator**: Reflex Logic™ and Mint Units™ enforce lifecycle governance at runtime — expiring, adapting, or burning credentials based on behavior, location, or anomalies.  
- **Evidence of systemic mirroring**: The appearance of similar protocols after MIT submission highlights the urgency and originality of this work, while raising questions about institutional handling of confidential innovation.  

